l Center, New York, NY, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Heissel S","firstName":"Søren","lastName":"Heissel","initials":"S","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Proteomics Resource Center, The Rockefeller University, New York, NY, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Masoudi A","firstName":"Ali","lastName":"Masoudi","initials":"A","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Medicine, Duke University Medical Center, Durham, NC, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Ben-Hail D","firstName":"Danya","lastName":"Ben-Hail","initials":"D","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0002-8210-3446"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Structural Biology Initiative, CUNY Advanced Science Research Center, New York, NY, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Samaan F","firstName":"Fadi","lastName":"Samaan","initials":"F","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0001-9124-5414"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Structural Biology Initiative, CUNY Advanced Science Research Center, New York, NY, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Dandey VP","firstName":"Venkata P","lastName":"Dandey","initials":"VP","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"The National Resource for Automated Molecular Microscopy, Simons Electron Microscopy Center, New York Structural Biology Center, New York, NY, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Tan YZ","firstName":"Yong Zi","lastName":"Tan","initials":"YZ","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0001-6656-6320"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"The National Resource for Automated Molecular Microscopy, Simons Electron Microscopy Center, New York Structural Biology Center, New York, NY, USA."},{"affiliation":"Department of Biochemistry and Molecular Biophysics, Columbia University Irving Medical Center, New York, NY, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Hong C","firstName":"Chuan","lastName":"Hong","initials":"C","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAff